THE WORK (real tickets from the tracker):
- AMSD-1919: Go-Checkout Page - Email & Confirm Email Case Sensitivity
    On the Go-Checkout page, the Email and Confirm Email fields are compared case-sensitively, so entering the same address with different letter casing (e.g. Name@Example.com vs name@example.com) incorrectly triggers a mismatch error. The comparison in CheckoutForm.tsx's confirmEmail validate rule must treat email addresses as equal regardless of casing, while still correctly flagging genuinely different addresses.

